{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Daily Driven Racer</strong> is a racing game that blends precision and mayhem. Master corners in classic circuit and sprint races, or dive into split-screen chaos with up to 4 players in modes like <i>Cops &amp; Robbers</i>, <i>Battle</i>, <i>Cruise</i>, and <i>Ball Game</i>. Built around familiar, everyday cars\u2014compact, clunky, or surprisingly quick\u2014DDR delivers fast, flexible gameplay with simple setup and zero grind. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Single Player Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Grand Tour Mode (Arcade):</strong> Race through a progressive series of events and conquer the tour.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Circuit Race:</strong> Challenge AI opponents across various track layouts.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Sprint Race:</strong> Short, point-to-point races against AI.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Challenges Mode:</strong> Face off in 1v1 races or complete timed challenges.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Time Trial:</strong> Race against yourself to perfect your lines and lap times.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ball Game:</strong> Play Football/Soccer with AI in a 2v2 match with Jump and Boost ability to shoot.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cruise Mode:</strong> Free roam with Jump and Boost abilities to explore around.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unlockable Progression:</strong> Earn new cars by completing game modes and challenges.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Split-Screen Multiplayer:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Up to <strong>4 players</strong> in local split-screen racing.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Circuit &amp; Sprint Races:</strong> Race against friends, AI, or a mix of both.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cops and Robbers Mode:</strong> One player is the cop, the other the robber\u2014chase, steal gold, and deliver it in high-stakes pursuits.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Battle Mode:</strong> Engage in vehicular combat with unique boost or jump mechanics. Last car standing wins.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ball Game:</strong> Play Football/Soccer in a 2v2 match with Jump and Boost ability to shoot.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cruise Mode:</strong> Free roam with Jump and Boost abilities to explore around with friends.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3522180?t=1754782295","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3522180?t=1754782295","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3522180/67bbade0e99e3d866e40687ec27f477d288446a4/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1754782295","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3522180/67bbade0e99e3d866e40687ec27f477d288446a4/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1754782295","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen PvP","id":37},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen Co-op","id":39},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen","id":24},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Remote Play Together","id":44},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":3762970,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Daily Driven Racer</strong> is a racing game that blends precision and mayhem. Master corners in classic circuit and sprint races, or dive into split-screen chaos with up to 4 players in modes like <i>Cops &amp; Robbers</i>, <i>Battle</i>, <i>Cruise</i>, and <i>Ball Game</i>. Built around f